+# TASK-260720-2g21eg review rework, cycle 2
+
+## Reviewed source state
+
+- CocoaSkills worktree:
+  `/Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills/.temp/TASK-260720-2g21eg/worktree`
