+| Source vs fresh installed-wheel `go_v1.py` comparison | exit 0; exact |
+| Source vs fresh installed-wheel `cli.py` comparison | exit 0; exact |
+| Fresh wheel-installed native macOS Go fixture | exit 0; 4 passed in 19.98s |
